    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi hi hi!\u00a0 Challenge your mind and help the spider in this minimalist and relaxing puzzle game! Connect the stars and create the perfect path for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the star to unlock other stars and paths, the available paths are represented by the purple star:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/e6c33ee1e2bac21ed040dd98a93f03a3.poster.avif?t=1755201072\" width=700 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/e6c33ee1e2bac21ed040dd98a93f03a3.webm?t=1755201072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the game, simply connect all the stars for the Spider to travel:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/22455ae3d5c914b3c8127c38e33084f4.poster.avif?t=1755201072\" width=700 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/22455ae3d5c914b3c8127c38e33084f4.webm?t=1755201072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game feature:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm and simple atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun music and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charismatic and cool spider</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi hi hi!\u00a0 Challenge your mind and help the spider in this minimalist and relaxing puzzle game! Connect the stars and create the perfect path for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the star to unlock other stars and paths, the available paths are represented by the purple star:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/e6c33ee1e2bac21ed040dd98a93f03a3.poster.avif?t=1755201072\" width=700 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/e6c33ee1e2bac21ed040dd98a93f03a3.webm?t=1755201072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the game, simply connect all the stars for the Spider to travel:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/22455ae3d5c914b3c8127c38e33084f4.poster.avif?t=1755201072\" width=700 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833470/extras/22455ae3d5c914b3c8127c38e33084f4.webm?t=1755201072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game feature:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm and simple atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun music and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charismatic and cool spider</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
